    "allegiance": "codex/word_bearers/allegiances/allegiance_word_bearers"
   },
   "text": "Requirements\n\n- Your army must include at least 2 unit of Ashen Circle units.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Chaos Champion upgraded to a Dark Apostle.\n- Your army must include 1 unit with the Daemon special rule.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Ashen Circle units as Troops choices.\n- Word Bearers Vehicle units in your army gain the Siege Attacker special rule.\n- Legionnaire Squads may purchase the Priest (1) special rule for 10pts. The unit only benefits from the Priest (x) special rule while the Aspiring Champion is alive.",
